  "headline": "Supreme Court Issues Contempt Notices Over Tirupparankundram Deepam",
  "seoTitle": "Supreme Court Orders Karthigai Deepam at Tirupparankundram",
  "metaDescription": "The Supreme Court has issued contempt notices to Tamil Nadu officials following a dispute over the lighting of the Karthigai Deepam at Tirupparankundram.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Supreme Court mandated that the Karthigai Deepam lamp be lit at Tirupparankundram hill under police protection.",
    "Contempt notices were issued to state officials for failing to follow previous directives regarding the lighting ceremony.",
    "The order has drawn varied responses from political figures, including support from the Tamil Nadu BJP leadership."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The legal dispute centers on the traditional lighting of the Karthigai Deepam lamp at Tirupparankundram, a practice that has faced significant administrative and local controversy. Following earlier petitions, the Supreme Court of India intervened, mandating that the lamp must be lit under the supervision of local police to ensure the event proceeds as intended. Recent reports indicate that the court issued contempt notices to relevant Tamil Nadu state authorities for their failure to implement previous court orders in a timely manner. The situation has intensified political debate within the region, with members of the BJP in Tamil Nadu publicly welcoming the court's intervention while local protests have occurred. Government officials are currently reviewing their next legal steps in response to the directives as the situation continues to evolve amidst broader discussions regarding judicial authority in local administrative affairs.",
